WEBVTT

00:52:25.525 --> 00:52:30.752
and help do drills
and teach English pronunciation,

00:52:30.776 --> 00:52:33.358
while the teacher does the mentoring,

00:52:33.382 --> 00:52:37.585
helps the kids figure out
their career, their future,

00:52:37.609 --> 00:52:40.133
helps them connect with other students

00:52:40.157 --> 00:52:43.366
and pay attention to their growth
and their weak areas

00:52:43.390 --> 00:52:45.522
and help them advance

00:52:45.546 --> 00:52:50.045
at maybe a much lower
student-to-teacher ratio.

00:52:50.069 --> 00:52:52.371
Another example is doctors.

00:52:52.395 --> 00:52:55.604
The human memory
and the human analytical engine

00:52:55.628 --> 00:52:57.731
cannot be matched against AI.

00:52:57.755 --> 00:53:03.603
AI is already beating people
in specific types of disease diagnosis.